| B | 2.7e‑3 | 8.8e‑4 | 82001 symptomatic gap 0.04912, not identified; the gate is unaffected either way |
| i | 9.2e‑3 | 5.7e‑3 | — |
| ii | 2.5e‑3 | 1.9e‑3 | — |

No decision is float-fragile.

