267:## 3. Independent libraries and shared targets
269:Generate one fresh panel and share its observed tables byte-for-byte across every library and batch. Each target gets its own process and observation pair. Every library gets twelve fresh pairs, assigned in advance to four ordered batches of three. Freeze an outcome-blind seed-generation procedure and ledger. Check disjointness across process seeds, observation seeds, roles, libraries, reserves and earlier campaigns, and verify the effective observation namespaces. Give each library the same sampling and build eligibility rules.
