273:After the authorizing ruling is committed, carry forward the builds-only pre-check, deterministic reserve order and frozen parent hashes. Keep and disclose reviewed fallback builds. Reserve exhaustion returns to the owner. Freeze the final ledger before study simulation, with no post-freeze replacement or retry. The draw distribution in §1 is therefore defined over buildable seeds under that declared procedure, including reviewed fallbacks. [G35-B predeclaration, §8](/home/steven/jos-g42-sol-ro/docs/research/v1_3/2026-10-22-g35b-predeclaration.md:295)
